{"src":"vi","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":201900,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"vi","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":9244.509283000001,"text":"Nếu bạn đã xem bộ phim Kho báo quốc gia, bạn có thể nghĩ bản đồ kho báo được viết trên mặt sau của bản tuyên ngôn độc lập."},{"kind":"text","t":10218.585682,"text":"If you have seen the movie National Treasure, you might think the treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":10342.107281,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10346.964351,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10351.948149,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10357.256252000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10362.605085000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10367.943678,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":10368.942321,"samples":12792,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":15905.700340000001,"text":"Sô-cô-la nóng tùy vào tiêu chuẩn bẩy, nước ép trái cây đắt tiền nhưng tuyệt vời."},{"kind":"text","t":16504.656047,"text":"Hot chocolate depends on the standard, fruit juice is expensive but wonderful."},{"kind":"audio","t":16627.085253999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16632.078771999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16637.562012,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":16642.936803999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":16644.489428999997,"samples":15328,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":10},{"kind":"input","t":24887.032766,"text":"Tuy nhiên điều đó không đúng, mặc dù có thứ gì đó được viết ở mặt sau của tài liệu nhưng đó không phải là bản đồ khó báo."},{"kind":"text","t":25899.428357999997,"text":"However, that is not true; although there is something written on the back of the document, it is not a treasure map."},{"kind":"audio","t":26010.928173,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26014.338756999998,"samples":26032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"audio","t":26099.830648,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26105.211209999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26110.160609,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":26115.726508,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":26116.052251999998,"samples":5128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":32657.453249,"text":"Bạn cũng có thể muốn tham khảo lời khuyên của các chính phủ khác."},{"kind":"text","t":33225.349075,"text":"You may also want to refer to the advice of other governments."},{"kind":"audio","t":33333.097142,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":33334.486569,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":33335.704899,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":140,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":33336.089533,"samples":10896,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":37798.266777,"text":"Ngoài chính phủ của bạn nhưng lời khuyên của họ là dành cho công dân của họ"},{"kind":"text","t":38389.083578,"text":"Aside from your government, their advice is intended for their own citizens."},{"kind":"audio","t":38496.457631,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38501.777784,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38507.181316,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38512.296362,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"audio","t":38512.654356,"samples":1528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":46810.528427,"text":"Đảo Hồng Kông đặt tên cho lãnh thổ Hồng Kông và đó là nơi mà nhiều du khách coi là tiêu điểm chính."},{"kind":"text","t":47785.407373,"text":"Hong Kong Island gives its name to the territory of Hong Kong, and it is where many tourists consider the main focal point."},{"kind":"audio","t":47908.941051,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47914.335823,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47919.634165999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47924.849251,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47930.190463,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47935.499776,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":47936.654187,"samples":12192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":54400.234628,"text":"Bất kỳ ai muốn lái xe trên khu vực cao hoặc băng đèo đều cần tân."},{"kind":"text","t":55066.586183,"text":"Anyone who wants to drive in the highlands or cross the passes needs a permit."},{"kind":"audio","t":55176.580923,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55181.724469,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":55187.023541999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":55192.398224,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1000},{"kind":"audio","t":55192.734208,"samples":6928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":57056.30949,"text":"Khả năng có tiết rơi"},{"kind":"text","t":57333.032411,"text":"Possibility of sleet"},{"kind":"audio","t":57439.878212999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":57441.549955,"samples":17032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":150},{"kind":"input","t":60142.469924,"text":"Băng hoặc đổ băng"},{"kind":"text","t":60335.945837,"text":"Ice or icing"},{"kind":"audio","t":60444.188286,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":60444.831164999996,"samples":11632,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":68003.835639,"text":"Sự phân tách và tái kết hợp diễn ra qua lại giữa hai nhóm qua mỗi thế hệ."},{"kind":"text","t":68614.874219,"text":"Separation and recombination occur reciprocally between the two groups across each generation."},{"kind":"audio","t":68734.089578,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68739.032057,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68744.34286,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68749.67271299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68754.973506,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":830},{"kind":"audio","t":68755.295381,"samples":2360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":75622.920019,"text":"Các nhà công trùng học sử dụng thuật ngữ bọ với."},{"kind":"text","t":76100.907576,"text":"Entomologists use the term \"bọ với.\""},{"kind":"audio","t":76207.863186,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76212.823095,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76218.195097,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":76223.797405,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"audio","t":76224.1208,"samples":6328,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":79777.58005599999,"text":"Nghĩa chính thức để đặt cho nhóm công trùng này"},{"kind":"text","t":80186.246338,"text":"The official name given to this group of insects"},{"kind":"audio","t":80297.463558,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80302.386587,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":250,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":80305.749642,"samples":24464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"input","t":86603.690153,"text":"Đầu tiên, hầu hết người cởi ngựa mang ủng có gót cao."},{"kind":"text","t":87083.995863,"text":"First, most riders wore high-heeled boots."},{"kind":"audio","t":87191.566812,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87196.888555,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87198.058886,"samples":13664,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":89486.614353,"text":"và đáy chân khá hẹp"},{"kind":"text","t":89776.711215,"text":"and the soles were quite narrow"},{"kind":"audio","t":89879.546632,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":89883.159373,"samples":28432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":630},{"kind":"input","t":98668.577125,"text":"Lệnh này là phản ứng của Maitreya với các cuộc biểu tình chống chế đạo lan rộng từ tháng 10."},{"kind":"text","t":99494.479989,"text":"This order was Maitreya's reaction to the anti-shamanism protests that spread from October."},{"kind":"audio","t":99614.102321,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":99619.527132,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":99624.859685,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":99629.963092,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":99635.464322,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":99635.778157,"samples":7160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":106360.423925,"text":"Tới 11h35 tối, đội cụ họa cuối cùng đã dùng nước nhập được ám tráng."},{"kind":"text","t":107334.346716,"text":"By 11:35 PM, the final team of painters had used the imported water to apply the dark glaze."},{"kind":"audio","t":107456.2898,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":107461.358207,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":107466.70458,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107472.025183,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107477.277857,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107482.682828,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":107483.026053,"samples":8592,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":112428.786843,"text":"Cơn bão được đặt tên Thới Mời của mùa bão."},{"kind":"text","t":112990.441391,"text":"The storm was named Thới Mời of the storm season."},{"kind":"audio","t":113109.71057899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":113115.218759,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113120.172158,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113125.782626,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":113131.318226,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":840},{"kind":"audio","t":113131.64362,"samples":3560,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":117555.00986,"text":"Atlantic bảo cân nhiệt đới Cherry đã hình thành tại biển Atlantic hôm nay."},{"kind":"text","t":118041.051376,"text":"Tropical storm Cherry has formed in the Atlantic Ocean today."},{"kind":"audio","t":118151.643446,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118156.721433,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":118162.116004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":118163.889275,"samples":16296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":20},{"kind":"input","t":124242.353688,"text":"Nó mang đến cho chúng ta xe lửa, xe hơi và nhiều phương tiện di chuyển khác."},{"kind":"text","t":124829.28838299999,"text":"It brought us trains, cars, and many other means of transportation."},{"kind":"audio","t":124942.716116,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124948.056089,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":124953.35967199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":124956.937284,"samples":25296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":132116.112082,"text":"Nó nổi tiếng là tiêu điểm của sự xa hoa bắt đầu từ khoảng 500-400 chức công nguyên."},{"kind":"text","t":133020.645803,"text":"It is famous for being a focal point of luxury starting from around 400-500 AD."},{"kind":"audio","t":133140.67365,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133145.850825,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133150.963111,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133156.400422,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":133161.855133,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":133162.090819,"samples":7760,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":137123.834305,"text":"và kéo dài đến tận khoảng năm 1100 sau Câu Nguyên."},{"kind":"text","t":137613.373466,"text":"and lasted until around 1100 AD."},{"kind":"audio","t":137713.667565,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137719.104176,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137723.260928,"samples":29264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":580},{"kind":"input","t":147067.227829,"text":"Bề mặt của mặt trăng được tạo nên bởi đá và bụi. Lớp bên ngoài của mặt trăng được gọi là lớp vỏ."},{"kind":"text","t":147633.80611,"text":"The surface of the moon is made of rock and dust. The outer layer of the moon is called the crust."},{"kind":"audio","t":147745.793658,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147750.771896,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147754.525205,"samples":26264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"audio","t":147840.768824,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147845.988539,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":147848.183703,"samples":18464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":153750.454781,"text":"Quân đoàn công binh Hoa Kỳ ước tính 6 inh nước mưa"},{"kind":"text","t":154276.449856,"text":"The US Army Corps of Engineers estimates 6 inches of rainfall"},{"kind":"audio","t":154378.565655,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154383.65904199998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154389.131892,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":154393.075858,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":158552.27396299999,"text":"có thể làm vỡ những đoạn đê đã bị hư tổn từ trước."},{"kind":"text","t":159002.693134,"text":"could break levee sections that were previously damaged."},{"kind":"audio","t":159108.96296499998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159114.16402999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159118.373421,"samples":29264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":630},{"kind":"input","t":166956.161684,"text":"Cụ thể, người ta cho rằng một người có thể phát hiện ai đó đang nói dối."},{"kind":"text","t":167577.862173,"text":"Specifically, it is believed that a person can detect when someone is lying."},{"kind":"audio","t":167690.059447,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1110},{"kind":"audio","t":167695.657846,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167700.447617,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167704.987953,"samples":30696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":680},{"kind":"input","t":171296.509865,"text":"bằng việc giải nghĩa chính xác từng biểu hiện các nhỏ."},{"kind":"text","t":171639.059821,"text":"by accurately interpreting each small expression."},{"kind":"audio","t":171750.048255,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":171755.501466,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":171758.31346,"samples":23264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":178935.133876,"text":"Đừng phá hoại cảnh quan bằng cách viết, vẽ, khách."},{"kind":"text","t":179519.2353,"text":"Do not deface the landscape by writing, drawing, or carving."},{"kind":"audio","t":179628.504843,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179630.182545,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179631.477244,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":179631.793559,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":191460.674837,"text":"Tiếng gàm cổ cạp không giống tiếng gàm góng của sư tử, mà giống như một chuỗi những tiếng gàm gừ trong cổ họng."},{"kind":"text","t":192468.512618,"text":"The roar of a tiger is not like the roar of a lion, but rather like a series of growls in the throat."},{"kind":"audio","t":192590.227257,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192595.58097,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192600.508739,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192605.872341,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":192611.231294,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":192611.539559,"samples":5960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":199875.619007,"text":"Các nghiên cứu thế kỷ 20 đã chứng minh rằng có 2 nhóm biến dị di truyền."},{"kind":"text","t":200581.790804,"text":"Twentieth-century studies have proven that there are 2 groups of genetic variations."},{"kind":"audio","t":200696.737693,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":200701.693772,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200707.014875,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200712.272569,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":200712.978128,"samples":9928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":201409.276726,"text":"Lặn và chọi"},{"kind":"text","t":201650.772615,"text":"Diving and fighting"},{"kind":"audio","t":201757.297382,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201758.182778,"samples":12832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"close","t":211906.207245,"code":1005}]}